.TP
\fBwaitUntil(promise)\fR
Tells the event dispatcher that work is ongoing. It can also be used to detect whether that work was successful.
\fBParameters:\fR
.br
\fIpromise\fR (Promise; required)
.TP
\fBwaitsFor()\fR
